@startuml crawlid-state
!include _style.puml
title Crawlid — State Machine

[*] --> Idle

state Idle : entry / patrol at CrawlidPatrolSpeed
state Turn : entry / flip facing,\n_isTurning = true, _turnTimer = 0\ndo / play turn animation (no move)

Idle --> Turn : wall hit / OnWallHit()
Idle --> Turn : spike ahead [collision probe]
Idle --> Turn : edge ahead [no ground]
Idle --> Turn : level boundary [x<=0 or x>=width] / clamp
Turn --> Idle : _turnTimer >= CrawlidTurnDuration

' Death: chosen by grounded flag at the moment health hits 0
state "DeathLand" as DeathLand : do / play death anim,\napply gravity + knockback decay
state "DeathAir" as DeathAir : do / fall (gravity),\nland -> DeathLand visuals

Idle --> DeathLand : Health <= 0 [IsGrounded]
Idle --> DeathAir  : Health <= 0 [airborne]
Turn --> DeathLand : Health <= 0 [IsGrounded]
Turn --> DeathAir  : Health <= 0 [airborne]
DeathAir --> DeathLand : ground reached

DeathLand --> [*]

@enduml
